---
import './lab-ui.css';
interface Props { lessonId?: string }
const { lessonId } = Astro.props;
const roadmap = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}roadmap/`;
---

<section class="learning-progress lab-ui not-content js-card" data-progress data-lesson={lessonId} data-pagefind-ignore aria-labelledby="learning-progress-title">
  <h2 id="learning-progress-title">{lessonId ? '本课学习进度' : '我的学习进度'}</h2>
  <p>进度保存在当前浏览器。换设备前可导出备份，再到另一台设备导入。</p>
  <div data-progress-controls hidden>
    <p data-progress-summary></p>
    <progress data-progress-meter max="48" value="0" aria-label="48 课完成进度"></progress>
    <div class="progress-actions">
      {lessonId && <button type="button" class="js-button" data-variant="primary" data-progress-toggle aria-pressed="false">标记完成</button>}
      {lessonId && <a class="roadmap-link" href={roadmap}>查看学习路线</a>}
      {!lessonId && <>
        <button type="button" class="js-button" data-variant="secondary" data-progress-export>导出进度</button>
        <button type="button" class="js-button" data-variant="secondary" data-progress-import>导入进度</button>
        <input data-progress-file type="file" accept="application/json,.json" aria-label="选择进度 JSON 文件" hidden />
      </>}
      <button type="button" class="js-button" data-variant="primary" data-progress-restore hidden>从本地备份恢复</button>
      <button type="button" class="js-button" data-variant="secondary" data-progress-restart hidden>重新开始</button>
    </div>
    {!lessonId && <p class="lab-note">导入会合并已完成的课程和已勾选的 Lab 步骤。需要重新学习时，可在对应课页撤销完成标记、在 Lab 页取消勾选。</p>}
    <p data-progress-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p class="lab-note">启用 JavaScript 后可记录学习进度；课程正文和练习可以继续阅读。</p></noscript>
</section>

<script>
  import '../scripts/learning-progress.mjs';
</script>

<style>
  .learning-progress { margin-block: 2rem; padding: 1.25rem; }
  h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--js-color-heading); font-size: var(--sl-text-h4); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; }
  p, [data-progress-controls] > * { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  [data-progress-summary] { color: var(--js-color-heading); font-weight: 650; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  progress {
    display: block; width: 100%; height: 0.6rem; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--js-border); accent-color: var(--js-color-primary);
  }
  progress::-webkit-progress-bar { background: var(--js-border); border-radius: 999px; }
  progress::-webkit-progress-value { background: var(--js-color-primary); border-radius: 999px; transition: width var(--js-motion) var(--js-ease); }
  progress::-moz-progress-bar { background: var(--js-color-primary); border-radius: 999px; }
  .progress-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem !important; }
  .js-button:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; }
  [data-progress-toggle][aria-pressed='true'] {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--js-color-ok) 55%, var(--js-border));
    background: var(--js-color-ok-soft); color: var(--js-color-heading);
  }
  [data-progress-toggle][aria-pressed='true']:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--js-color-ok) 22%, transparent); }
  .roadmap-link, .roadmap-link:visited, .roadmap-link:hover, .roadmap-link:focus-visible { color: var(--js-color-primary); font-weight: 650; }
</style>
